# Frontend Kuralları

Önce oku: `docs/02_DESIGN/MASTER_PRODUCT_AND_DESIGN_DIRECTION.md` (**LOCKED SSOT**), `docs/05_FRONTEND/FRONTEND_ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/02_DESIGN/` (subordinate), `docs/08_API/API_SPECIFICATION.md`

Mobile-first / Desktop-ready: tek design system; platform-forked UI yasak. Creator Economy: core culture paywall yok.

## Onaylı stack

- **Mobile:** Expo SDK, Expo Router, TypeScript, TanStack Query, Zustand, NativeWind, Reanimated, Lucide
- **Web:** Next.js App Router, Tailwind, shadcn/ui (TECH_STACK_DECISIONS)
- **Forms:** React Hook Form + Zod
- **Realtime:** WebSocket client (Socket.IO events per API spec)

## Mimari

- Feature-first: `features/{domain}/` — components, hooks, api, store, screens
- **Server state:** TanStack Query (stale 30s, cache 5min, optimistic updates, infinite queries for feed)
- **Global state:** Zustand (auth, theme, user, settings)
- **Local state:** React state only (UI, forms, animations)
- API layer per feature: `{feature}.api.ts`, `{feature}.types.ts`, `{feature}.mapper.ts` — no direct Axios in components
- No business logic in components; use hooks/services

## Routing (Expo Router)

`app/(auth)/`, `app/(tabs)/`, `game/`, `review/`, `settings/` — align with NAVIGATION_SPECIFICATION

## Performance targets

Launch <2s, Feed <1s, Navigation <300ms, Game detail <500ms, Search <300ms

## UI

- Components from `COMPONENT_LIBRARY.md` only
- Design tokens mandatory; motion per `MOTION_GUIDELINES.md`
- Accessibility per `ACCESSIBILITY.md`
